{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"]},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"FSI Portuguese Programmatic Course \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7","text":"<p>Welcome! This is my personal, lightweight, offline\u2011friendly version of the Foreign Service Institute's Portuguese Programmatic Course \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7. Enjoy!  - Lauren</p>"},{"location":"about/","title":"About this site \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7","text":"<p>These files were legally obtained from the US Department of State's Foreign Service Institute. I am not affiliated with the US Government in any way, and this is not an attempt to impersonate a government program.  I just wanted an efficient way to learn Portuguese \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 on the go :)   Special thanks to The Yojik Website for the FSI course materials.</p>"},{"location":"about/#build-information","title":"Build Information","text":"Git Commit: loading... Build Time: loading... Last Updated: loading..."},{"location":"extras/volume1-course/","title":"Volume 1 - Complete Course","text":"<p>This is the complete Volume 1 course document of the FSI Portuguese Programmatic course.</p>","tags":["extras","volume1","course"]},{"location":"extras/volume1-course/#pdf-document-embedded","title":"PDF Document (embedded)","text":"","tags":["extras","volume1","course"]},{"location":"extras/volume1-instructors-manual/","title":"Volume 1 - Instructors Manual","text":"<p>This is the instructor's manual for Volume 1 of the FSI Portuguese Programmatic course.</p>","tags":["extras","volume1","manual"]},{"location":"extras/volume1-instructors-manual/#pdf-document-embedded","title":"PDF Document (embedded)","text":"","tags":["extras","volume1","manual"]},{"location":"extras/volume1-introduction/","title":"Volume 1 - Introduction","text":"<p>This is the introduction document for Volume 1 of the FSI Portuguese Programmatic course.</p>","tags":["extras","volume1","introduction"]},{"location":"extras/volume1-introduction/#pdf-docu